Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:03.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fuwari, you doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:05.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're doing great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.33,0:00:09.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's almost time for the Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:12.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Our rival is the Prodigy Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.69,0:00:14.47,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Its members are quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.47,0:00:17.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie-san and Shion-san have also joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:20.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're prodigies, so there's not much we could do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.09,0:00:23.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}So the rest of us formed Team Effort to compete with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:26.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mirei is especially pumped up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.75,0:00:28.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll also be putting even more into this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.73,0:00:30.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Way more than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:33.42,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wish to reform PriPara if I win.{EP73}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:35.61,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}We'll take you up on it!{EP73}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:38.93,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,{\i1}And your arraignment will have to wait until we win!{EP73}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.93,0:00:42.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anyway, there's no way we'll lose this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.70,0:00:45.16,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's all I have for now, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:49.11,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come back from the Palps as soon as you feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.34,0:00:52.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:55.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,President Minami!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:56.44,Default,Minami,0,0,0,,Manaka-san...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:57.63,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.63,0:00:59.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We're finally going to be on the same team!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:02.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I feel the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:04.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll do the best I can with my inner strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:07.12,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That's right, this'll be a piece of cake since I'm on the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:11.61,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,That hastily made Prodigy Team will fall apart just like the bits you lose in the deep fryer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.61,0:01:12.32,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:13.01,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.01,0:01:13.59,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:14.80,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Let's do the best we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.80,0:01:17.51,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And, as our name suggests, we'll put in effort every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.51,0:01:18.97,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:50.68,Default,All,0,0,0,,Showdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:52.79,Default,All,0,0,0,,At The Winter GrandPrix!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.86,0:02:57.86,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,From here on out we'll be acting separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:00.80,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Since we'll be concentrating on our training,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:05.33,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,we won't be able to talk to each other until after our début concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.72,0:03:07.08,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Got it-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.92,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This is Mikan's food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:14.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Any other important notes are in this caretakers guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.33,0:03:15.38,Default,Andou,0,0,0,,{Memememememe}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:19.63,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Allow us to go all out and have a battle that will shake the heavens!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.63,0:03:21.10,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Everything is on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:22.14,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I won't hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.14,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,There's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:24.39,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,...we'll lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:27.39,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I want to eat together on New Year's Day...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.39,0:03:30.14,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Lala, let's do our best against each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.14,0:03:31.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.43,0:03:36.04,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,All right, let's head to our dressing room, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:37.86,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Kim!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:39.99,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Hold on-matisse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.63,0:03:42.95,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Take care, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:44.41,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Thanks be to the Picture of Reiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:50.37,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,This is sudden, but Ponkan will be returning to Persailles, Prance-daVinci.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.37,0:03:51.08,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Where's Persailles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:55.03,Default,MIrei,0,0,0,,It's near PriPari-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.03,0:03:56.79,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,It's Ponkan's hometown-daVinci!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.72,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Everyone's a cicada friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.52,0:04:04.18,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.18,0:04:06.41,Default,Ajimi,0,0,0,,Good luck at the WinDrea-terracotta!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:09.29,Default-Alt,Ajimi,0,0,0,,The Great Buddha Statue of Nara bids thee bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.15,0:04:10.60,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And she leaves like a storm-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.60,0:04:13.06,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Get us some souvenirs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:19.87,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:25.03,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Time to dig in-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.49,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Hi there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.49,0:04:29.83,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go! You even have one!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.83,0:04:33.66,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Mage-chan must have gathered all these for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:36.77,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Did you tamper with the system again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:37.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:40.55,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Have you not seen a top class dressing room before?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:41.73,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.73,0:04:43.76,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Isn't being part of a team thrilling?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:52.77,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,You see, the excitement from back then has always remained here, inside Falulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:55.95,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,You've always put on solo concerts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.95,0:04:58.02,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Yeah, so this is exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:04:58.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.91,0:05:02.49,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's practise as much as we can and put on a great concert for Falulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:05.35,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Actually, for those chosen as prodigies,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:10.74,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,overexerting or singing yourself hoarse are unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:13.04,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,1, 2, pri, pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:13.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\an8}1, 2, ca, pisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:14.82,Default-Alt,Aloma,0,0,0,,3, 4, devi, devi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:16.70,Default-Alt,Dorothy,0,0,0,,5, 6, ma, x.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.79,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,7, 8, pri, pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.79,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\an8}7, 8, re, lax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:20.83,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,1, 2, ca, pisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:22.45,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Yes, great, they're in perfect sync-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:23.97,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,They're looking good-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.97,0:05:25.09,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,This isn't enough-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.09,0:05:29.05,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I'm sure the Prodigy Team is practising even harder right now-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:30.91,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,1, 2, pri, pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.05,0:05:30.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\an8}1, 2, ca, pisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:32.88,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,3, 4, pri, pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:32.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\an8}3, 4, devi, devi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.78,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,5, 6, pri, pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.78,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,{\an8}5, 6, ma, x.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:37.02,Default-Alt,Mirei,0,0,0,,7, 8, pri, pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:37.02,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\an8}7, 8, re, lax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:45.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I decided to reuse this boat that was abandoned at the dock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.16,0:05:48.95,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It seems like it was last used about three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:53.85,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's said that Puhrphil Symphony No. 5, conducted by Purtwängler,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:55.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,is a famous and legendary piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:58.42,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What a beautiful song.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:06:00.42,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What about practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:05.38,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We'll be fine with a single practice run the day before WinDrea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.22,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:11.24,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,More importantly, we'll take in this first-class art and use it as inspiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.46,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,This is most fitting for a prodigy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.18,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's the first step towards my ideal CelePara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:17.50,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,CelePara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:19.77,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,The AsParagus is delicious, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:22.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That felt great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.35,0:06:24.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Now that we're in sync,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:26.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,it's time to choose the theme for our next concert-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:31.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We totally have to make our fans at the Dream Theatre feel like they've been taken to a world of dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.87,0:06:35.31,Default-Alt,Dorothy,0,0,0,,The Ninja's Ally Monja Man -Space Edition-!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.31,0:06:37.08,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.08,0:06:38.35,Default,Larela,0,0,0,,Rejected!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.35,0:06:39.54,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.24,0:06:44.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The first chapter of the Aloma Prophesy Grimoire reads as thus:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:48.26,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"The five witches who manipulate long things will bring forth a miracle"-dealo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:49.97,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Long things?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.98,0:06:52.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah! Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,How does turning into witches and dancing sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.67,0:06:59.80,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We can cast magic while dancing with a broom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.80,0:07:03.36,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,"We're all friends! We're all idols!"{EP73 and probably others}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:07.03,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Witches, brooms, magic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.32,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Not a bad idea-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:11.67,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,But can we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.67,0:07:12.99,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.99,0:07:15.79,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Dancing while holding brooms sounds difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.17,0:07:20.71,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,If it's difficult, it means it'll also be rewarding-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:22.93,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's been like that the whole time-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.93,0:07:26.17,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's not like we were just playing at being friends-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:29.05,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We've been through many hardships, have learned a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.09,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,and have really worked our selves to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.09,0:07:32.79,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It may have only been a little at a time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.87,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,but we have ranked up-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:40.64,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,So this time, I'm sure we can do our best by putting in 102% effort-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.64,0:07:41.85,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:42.92,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.92,0:07:45.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,in that case, I'll um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:48.17,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,...add 30% to that 102%!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.17,0:07:50.53,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,And I'll add 33%!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.53,0:07:53.04,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Then I shall increase it by 36%-dealo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.15,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,You're all being quite reserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.15,0:07:59.87,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,With it being the five of us, I'll max it out with another 100%!{there's also a tadah in here...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:05.08,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,According to my calculations, that adds up to 301%-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:06.63,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:09.36,Default,Managers,0,0,0,,Mi-re-i!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:10.30,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,59)}Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:10.30,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,{\pos(927,59)}Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:10.30,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\pos(343,59)}Nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Hooray! It's Mirei! It's Mirei!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:14.31,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,All right! We're all on board-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.49,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We're in for some intense training with the 301% effort-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.00,Default,All,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:21.93,Default,All,0,0,0,,Ready, set...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.45,0:08:25.59,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Manaka-san, hold it 5 cm this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.99,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Kurosu-san, you were three seconds off on the jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.99,0:08:29.56,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Leona, you need to smile more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.78,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,And Dorothy, you need to jump 7.3 mm higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.78,0:08:33.26,Default-Alt,Dorothy,0,0,0,,So small!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.25,0:08:50.63,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Can you see, Falulu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.63,0:08:52.34,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.66,0:08:59.38,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I will have you see all of the works the\NPrademy Awards have given awards to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.38,0:09:04.31,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,In addition, there's also ballet, opera, fine arts, and industrial arts...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.73,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.73,0:09:08.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.84,0:09:10.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Hey, I understand your feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:12.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,but we both have special training-dearu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.36,0:09:13.69,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Come on, Mikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.69,0:09:15.36,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Just a little-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.36,0:09:18.70,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan's lacking Aloma and needs a charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.21,0:09:22.03,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's starting to come together-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:23.82,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,No, we're not there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.82,0:09:26.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,We have yet to reach 301%!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:28.25,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Let's do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.72,0:09:31.96,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:33.92,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Don't you think this colour would be good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.92,0:09:38.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Hey, I want this dance formation to be more elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.07,0:09:40.20,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I see, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:42.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,How about something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:43.88,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:44.81,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.23,0:09:48.56,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,301%...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.56,0:09:50.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirei... Mirei...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:56.20,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,It's been a while since it's felt like our hearts have come together as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.88,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Dorothy West,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:04.09,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Leona West,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:05.91,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Kurosu Aloma,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.91,0:10:06.58,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:08.17,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll have to show it off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:10.51,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,My burning inner strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.51,0:10:11.54,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,...Manaka Lala.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:15.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,With the five of us, I'm sure a miracle will come about!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,No, it has to!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We're all friends! We're all idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.11,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,It's finally time for the WinDrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.11,0:10:32.15,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Which team do you think will win?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.15,0:10:34.15,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,That's a no brainier, the Prodigy Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.15,0:10:35.50,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,I think so too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:37.19,Default,Eiko,0,0,0,,You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:40.11,Default,Nao,0,0,0,,Lala and her team have been putting in a lot of effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:43.88,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,This day has finally come...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:48.22,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,In my position, I must treat all idols fairly,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.22,0:10:52.08,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,but this time Team Effort has been on my mind more than any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.57,0:10:55.39,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but do you think you could change the commentator?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.39,0:10:56.95,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Sorry, no can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.95,0:10:59.30,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,But aren't the two of us friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.26,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,It's the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.52,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.52,0:11:05.06,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:08.73,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.18,0:11:14.82,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It's the blanket of your heart, Mega-nii!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:17.91,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I'll gently wrap around you any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.91,0:11:18.65,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It'll be fluffy-fluffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.88,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Now then, despite this being the WinDrea,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:31.12,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,most of the teams have dropped out, saying they wouldn't stand a chance against the Prodigy Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.12,0:11:32.63,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,As a result...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.63,0:11:35.77,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,...it'll be a showdown between these two teams!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:40.34,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,So without further ado, it's time for our first team!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.30,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:44.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:46.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We haven't decided on a team name yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:47.73,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.73,0:11:49.82,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,We were so engrossed in our training that we forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.82,0:11:51.21,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Worry not-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:52.73,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,I've got an idea-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.13,0:11:56.06,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We're all friends. We're all idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.06,0:11:58.19,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,As those feelings are dear to us...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:02.65,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:08.14,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The ribbon of an apprentice witch shows her clumsiness and coolness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.14,0:12:09.71,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,And she'll always get through it with a smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Little Witch Ribbon Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.03,0:12:16.68,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,The stars' light will illuminate the path to the heights apprentice witches aim for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.68,0:12:18.34,Default,Mirerothy,0,0,0,,Little Witch Starlight Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:19.13,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.13,0:12:20.17,Default,Dorothy,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.17,0:12:21.44,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Your heart will skip a beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:23.77,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Even an apprentice witch's appeal is real!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.77,0:12:25.59,Default,Aloona,0,0,0,,Little Witch Heartful Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.59,0:12:26.56,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:33.97,Default,Friendols,0,0,0,,Friendols's concert is now starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:33.97,Default,Friendols,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(427,639)}(Friends + Idols)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:36.10,Default,Rands,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.56,0:12:41.47,Default,Friendols,0,0,55,,Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.76,0:12:49.99,Default,Fans,0,0,55,,So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.34,0:13:03.34,Default,Lala,0,0,55,,{\i1}We are fledgling witches,{dunces...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.34,0:13:06.52,Default,Lala,0,0,55,,{\i1}but we'll show you that our dreams will come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:18.61,Default,Mirei,0,0,55,,{\i1}Magic to make everyone into {idol's}beautifully smiling idols{idols with wonderful smiles}-pri!{beautifully smiling idols or something could work. Just went literal.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.39,0:13:27.91,Default,Kuma,0,0,55,,What an exciting concert-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:29.61,Default,Toriko,0,0,55,,Their singing and dancing is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:31.32,Default,Neko,0,0,55,,Not to mention their teamwork!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.32,0:13:33.75,Default,Neko,0,0,55,,You couldn't do that without a lot of practice-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:39.92,Default,Lala,0,0,55,,Airy Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.60,0:13:43.17,Default,Friendols,0,0,55,,Cyalume Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.89,0:13:45.63,Default,Mirei,0,0,55,,{\i1}This isn't the Winter Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.81,0:13:53.77,Default,Lala,0,0,55,,{\i1}The bell didn't appear...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.49,0:14:09.03,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is the loudest I've heard the crowd cheer since the Dream Theatre opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.03,0:14:11.99,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And with that, their idol rankings have gone up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:18.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,My inner strength didn't come out...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.73,0:14:20.03,Default,Mirei,0,0,0,,We lost-pri...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.97,0:14:25.13,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Are you sure we're okay with only practising once?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:26.78,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,I'm not confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.10,0:14:29.84,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We've decided on the arrangement, the rest you can ad lib.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.84,0:14:30.84,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Ad lib?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.54,0:14:35.38,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Feel each other's mood from moment to moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.38,0:14:38.43,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and based on your instinct, dance while aiming for perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.43,0:14:41.71,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Our concert will be a battle between members.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.71,0:14:44.48,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I know you have it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:46.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,That's why I chose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:48.59,Default-Alt,Falulu,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.69,0:14:48.59,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:51.16,Default,Shiphy,0,0,0,,Based on our instincts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.27,0:14:54.25,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:03.73,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,A sharp celebrity tuxedo style for escorting the princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.96,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Escort Cinema Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.45,0:15:12.92,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Here we have this gently flowing dress skirt with it's full volume feel and lots of frills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.92,0:15:15.23,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,It gives off quite an elegant silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:17.02,Default,Shikan,0,0,0,,Ballroom Cinema Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:18.14,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelrun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.14,0:15:19.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:22.50,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,For additional accent they have large bird feathers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:26.51,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,They're a focal point as they decorate the chest and legs and are a hair accessory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.51,0:15:28.36,Default,Shilulu,0,0,0,,Ballroom Pearl Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:40.28,Default,Shilulu,0,0,0,,Allow us actresses wearing clothing of talent to show you the true beauty that is PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.59,0:15:43.38,Default,Shilulu,0,0,0,,We are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.88,0:15:46.09,Default,Shilulu,0,0,0,,...CelePara Theatre Company!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.09,0:15:49.42,Default,CelePara Opera Company,0,0,0,,Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:12.61,Default,Hibiki,0,0,45,,Airy Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.62,Default,Hibiki,0,0,45,,Golden Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.05,0:17:20.81,Default,Rest,0,0,0,,Golden Airy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:29.31,Default,Sophie,0,0,45,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.31,0:17:31.29,Default,Falulu,0,0,0,,So sparkly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:33.86,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.41,Default,Mikan,0,0,45,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:56.71,Default,Solulu,0,0,45,,Ring the bell of everyone's dreams!{consistency 56 - tho this set is a bit different}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:59.85,Default,Shikan,0,0,0,,Aim for a limitless height.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:04.60,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Echo, Bell of Revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:37.76,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,CelePara Theatre Company wins by a landslide!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:40.22,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've felt this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:42.42,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,My heart won't stop trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.97,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:45.52,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,My heart's beating ecstatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:49.94,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Will you entrust the future of PriPara to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:54.22,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,If you do, I promise to return PriPara to its golden age!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:55.65,Default-Alt,Rand3,0,0,0,,I love you, Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:57.11,Default-Alt,Rand4,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:19:01.70,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Minami Mirei-kun, you know what this cheer means, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.11,0:19:04.91,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:07.35,Default-Alt,Rand5,0,0,0,,Falulu is shining!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:08.12,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,And with that, Mega-niisan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.77,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.77,0:19:12.08,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Please allow me to reform PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.79,0:19:15.75,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,To do that, I need your glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:21.13,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,You were born to support and protect these idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:25.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,As an idol who gets so much support from this idol audience,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:28.48,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,you should give me that chance you promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:29.85,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.85,0:19:32.31,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,And the tally of likes are in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:37.23,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Several idols have jumped up the rankings here as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.23,0:19:39.05,Default,Rand6,0,0,0,,Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.05,0:19:41.20,Default,Rand7,0,0,0,,My Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:44.85,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was born to protect these idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.53,0:19:49.66,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wonder if she can make these idols happy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.82,0:19:52.62,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.91,0:19:56.56,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,Please, these idols need...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:01.46,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,I'm returning from Stylish Tough Guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.98,0:20:04.09,Default,Mega-nii,0,0,0,,...to a normal guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.94,0:20:13.09,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:16.99,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,let us celebrate as the curtains rise on a place where prodigies gather,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.99,0:20:19.61,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,the new PriPara, CelePara!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:35.46,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.91,0:20:39.27,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Our 301% effort lost-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.27,0:20:39.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirei...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.12,0:22:16.94,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.94,0:22:18.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This is PriPara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.74,0:22:21.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Better yet, what is CelePara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:22.31,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The revolution has come-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.31,0:22:23.73,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It's terrible-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.73,0:22:25.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mirei, what do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.39,0:22:27.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's go! CelePara!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.93,0:22:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,
